source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Jira consumes the backslash before `{` and `}`, so an escaped brace pair is not a macro.
-- input.jira --
a\{b\}c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a{b}c</p>
-- want.md --
a{b}c
-- warnings.json --
[]
